        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- Products: Greater Swiss Mountain Dog, Harrier\n- Places: Swiss Alps\n- Concepts: dog breeds, hound class\n- Roles: top-ranked show dog\n\nFacts:\n- The Greater Swiss Mountain Dog is a dog breed developed in the Swiss Alps.\n- The Greater Swiss Mountain Dog is also known in German as Grosser Schweizer Sennenhund and in French as Grand Bouvier Suisse.\n- The Harrier is a medium-sized dog breed in the hound class.\n- Oscar the Grouch is a top-ranked Greater Swiss Mountain Dog.\n- Oscar the Grouch appeared on an opening promo for the Dog Show on the USA Network and on Bloomberg.",
